        "code": "-- Fine-Grained Row Lock Acquisition Modes\nCREATE TABLE inventory_items (\n    item_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n    item_sku TEXT,\n    stock_qty INT,\n    reserved_qty INT\n);\nINSERT INTO inventory_items VALUES\n(1, 'LAPTOP-PRO-16', 50, 5),\n(2, 'PHONE-ULTRA-MAX', 120, 15),\n(3, 'TABLET-AIR-11', 35, 2);\n\n-- Acquiring fine-grained FOR NO KEY UPDATE lock on non-key payload\nSELECT \n    item_id,\n    item_sku,\n    stock_qty,\n    'FOR_NO_KEY_UPDATE' AS lock_strength,\n    'PERMITS_CONCURRENT_FOREIGN_KEY_CHECKS' AS concurrency_behavior\nFROM inventory_items\nWHERE item_id = 1;",
