        "output": " lifecycle_tier_name  | data_age_boundary  | read_write_workload_profile            | physical_storage_tablespace   | cost_per_gigabyte_relative       | automated_action_trigger\n----------------------+--------------------+----------------------------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------\n Hot Active Tier      | 0 to 90 Days       | Intensive Concurrent Read-Write (OLTP) | nvme_fast_primary_pool        | High Cost (Top-tier NVMe)        | Continuous WAL streaming backup\n Cold Archive Tier    | 1 to 5 Years       | Infrequent Compliance Audits           | cloud_object_parquet_store    | Ultra-Low Cost (Cloud Object S3) | DETACH CONCURRENTLY; export to Parquet\n Warm Query Tier      | 91 to 365 Days     | Read-Only Historical Analytics         | standard_ssd_analytics_pool   | Medium Cost (Standard SSD)       | Migrate tablespace; compress local indexes\n Purge Retention Tier | Older than 5 Years | Zero Operational Traffic               | Unallocated Storage Free Pool | Zero Cost (Storage Deallocated)  | DROP TABLE partition; instant disk unlink\n(4 rows)"
