          "why": "Virtual sharding moves only the specific buckets assigned to the new nodes, avoiding the massive whole-cluster data reshuffling required by naive modulus hashing.",
          "explanation": "Virtual sharding moves only the specific buckets assigned to the new nodes, avoiding the massive whole-cluster data reshuffling required by naive modulus hashing."
