        "output": " rebalancing_strategy               | data_movement_percentage                         | client_traffic_downtime                               | underlying_migration_mechanism                              | production_resiliency_grade\n------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------\n Citus Distributed Tenant Rebalance | Isolated tenant partition migration              | Zero downtime; tenant queries rerouted on completion  | Citus non-blocking rebalancer with distributed 2PC locking  | Hyperscale multi-tenant SaaS standard\n Naive Modulus Re-Hashing           | Up to 100% of all data reshuffled across cluster | Hours of downtime; requires cluster-wide write lock   | Full table export, re-hash, and bulk import                 | Unacceptable for mission-critical enterprise systems\n Virtual Shard Consistent Hashing   | Minimal data movement (K/N proportion only)      | Zero downtime; non-blocking live background migration | Logical replication CDC stream + sub-second catalog cutover | Enterprise standard for 24/7 continuous operation\n(3 rows)"
